{
  "provenance": "Original deterministic synthesis (numpy, fixed seeds). No external samples, recordings or paid API.",
  "listening": "OPEN. The owner heard the first set in play on 2026-09-27 (\"too calm ... add some sirens ... louder and more variety of beeps\"); this rework answers that and has not been heard. Authored SFX stay provisional until the owner hears them in play (CLAUDE.md section 6).",
